  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "するどいキバで　なんにでも　かみつく。\nもともと　アローラには　すんでおらず\nほかのちほうから　つれてこられた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "날카로운 이빨로 아무거나 물어버린다.\n원래 알로라에 서식하지 않고\n다른 지방에서 데리고 왔다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "銳利的牙齒可咬住任何東西。\n原本並不住在阿羅拉，\n是從其他地區被帶過來的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Avec ses crocs acérés, il ne peut s’empêcher\nde mordre tout ce qui bouge. Il fut introduit à\nAlola il y a longtemps, depuis une autre région.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit seinen scharfen Zähnen schnappt es nach\nallem. Es lebte ursprünglich nicht in Alola und\nwurde aus einer anderen Region eingeführt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus afilados colmillos lo atraviesan todo. No es\nautóctono de Alola, sino que proviene de otra\nregión.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Addenta qualsiasi cosa con le sue zanne\naguzze. È stato introdotto ad Alola tempo fa\nda un’altra regione.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "With its sharp fangs, it will bite anything.\nIt did not originally live in Alola but was\nimported from another region.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "鋭いキバで　なんにでも　かみつく。\n元々　アローラには　棲んでおらず\n他の地方から　連れてこられた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "无论什么都能用锐利的牙齿咬住。\n原本并不住在阿罗拉，\n是从其他地区被带过来的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus afilados colmillos lo atraviesan todo. No es\nautóctono de Alola, sino que proviene de otra\nregión.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "エサを　さがし　うろつきつづける。\nひが　くれるころには　つかれはて\nたおれこむように　そのばで　ねむる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "먹이를 찾아 계속 돌아다닌다.\n날이 저물 즈음엔 지쳐서\n쓰러지듯이 그 자리에서 잠든다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "不斷徘徊著尋找食物。\n到了太陽下山的時候，\n會因為精疲力盡而一頭倒下睡著。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il furète du matin au soir en quête de nourriture.\nLa nuit, exténué, il tombe comme une brique\net s’endort sur place.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die Futtersuche treibt es unaufhörlich umher,\ndoch sobald die Sonne untergeht, wird es von\nMüdigkeit überfallen und schläft sofort ein.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Deambula todo el día en busca de alimento. Al\nanochecer, exhausto, se deja caer en cualquier\nlugar y se queda dormido.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si muove continuamente in cerca di cibo.\nQuando si fa sera crolla esausto al suolo\ne si addormenta sul posto.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It wanders around in a never-ending search for\nfood. At dusk, it collapses from exhaustion and\nfalls asleep on the spot.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "餌を　探し　うろつき続ける。\n日が　暮れるころには　疲れ果て\n倒れ込むように　その場で　眠る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "不断巡回着寻找食物。\n到了太阳落山的时候，\n因为精疲力尽而一头栽倒就这么睡着。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Deambula todo el día en busca de alimento. Al\nanochecer, exhausto, se deja caer en cualquier\nlugar y se queda dormido.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ながい　どうたいの　なかみは\nほとんど　いぶくろ。　おおぐいなので\nエサだいは　バカに　ならない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "긴 몸통은 거의 위장으로\n이루어져 있다. 대식가여서\n식비를 무시할 수 없다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "長長的身體內部幾乎\n全被胃佔滿。因為食量很大，\n飼養牠的伙食費相當驚人。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son estomac occupe la plus grande partie de\nson long corps. Le Dresseur de ce gros mangeur\ndoit prévoir un budget nourriture conséquent.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein Magen füllt beinahe das gesamte Innere\nseines länglichen Körpers aus. Die bei diesem\nVielfraß anfallenden Futterkosten sind enorm.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El estómago le ocupa gran parte de su largo\ncuerpo. Alimentar a este auténtico tragaldabas\nno es moco de pavo, por el coste que conlleva.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lo stomaco occupa la maggior parte del suo\nlungo corpo. È un gran mangione e mantenerlo\ncosta davvero un occhio della testa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its stomach takes up most of its long torso.\nIt’s a big eater, so the amount Trainers have to\nspend on its food is no laughing matter.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "長い　胴体の　中身は\nほとんど　胃袋。　大食いなので\nエサ代は　バカに　ならない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "长长的躯体里面基本都是胃。\n因为食量很大，伙食费不可小觑。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El estómago le ocupa gran parte de su largo\ncuerpo. Alimentar a este auténtico tragaldabas\nno es moco de pavo, por el coste que conlleva.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "なんでも　たべるが　しんせんで\nいきているものが　いいので　えものを\nさがして　みちを　ねりあるく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "무엇이든 먹지만 신선하고\n살아 있는 것을 좋아해서\n먹이를 찾아 길을 누비고 다닌다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "雖然什麼都吃，但特別\n偏好活生生的新鮮食物，\n會為了尋找獵物而四處遊走。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il mange de tout, mais aime particulièrement\nles proies fraîches, voire encore vives. Il erre\nsur les routes à leur recherche.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ist zwar ein Allesfresser, bevorzugt aber\nfrische oder lebendige Nahrung. Auf der Suche\nnach Beute marschiert es die Straßen entlang.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pese a ser omnívoro, siente predilección por los\nalimentos frescos o incluso seres vivos. Por eso\nmarcha por los caminos en busca de presas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gli Yungoos mangiano di tutto ma preferiscono\ncibo fresco o prede vive. Si vedono spesso\nsfilare lungo le strade alla ricerca di cibo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Although it will eat anything, it prefers fresh\nliving things, so it marches down streets\nin search of prey.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "なんでも　食べるが　新鮮で\n生きているものが　いいので\n獲物を　探して　道を　練り歩く。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "什么都吃，但喜欢吃新鲜的活物。\n所以会为了寻找猎物在路上四处游走。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
